4	 * Pipeline marker published by {@link MarkDeclaredHouseholdMember} when a create-owner request opted
5	 * into sharing a household that already has a member. Its presence tells {@link DetectPossibleDuplicate}
6	 * that the owner is a declared household member and so must not be flagged as a possible duplicate —
7	 * a deliberately declared member is not a suspected one. Absent (the variable stays {@code null})
8	 * for every other owner.
9	 */
10	enum DeclaredHouseholdMember {
11	    INSTANCE
12	}
